      "created_at": "2026-02-23T00:25:29.578Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all, I need to add a field in the Method of payment form of the POS.<br>\nThe field is for the reference of the payments, for example, to save the bank transfer reference when the payment is with bank transfer.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f\" title=\"Screenshot_3\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f_2_690x313.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_3\" data-base62-sha1=\"uvGNWol7DuEzjMZd6zknf6kpT9Z\" width=\"690\" height=\"313\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f_2_690x313.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f_2_1035x469.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d5d6490e9c096143c66b43aef395cc9b6c24853f.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_3</span><span class=\"informations\">1312×596 55.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>With the Sales Invoice view I found the field, but I need to do that with POS. Is it possible?</p>",
